  character_Name: 
  character_Type: Corporate
  character_Bio: "You\u2019re not like the other who look for this type of work,
    looking for their next big break, or to get a hold of as much money as possible.
    Instead, this gig is much more personal. Recently, you acquired a wealthy client
    whom you stole from Pawz Bank. Even though you did all the hard work, you never
    received the recognition or the financial compensation you deserved; instead,
    your check was cut due to \u201Cbudget cuts\u201D. Running low on ideas, you
    decide it\u2019s time to take matters into your own hands and prove to Fangs
    & Finances why they need you more than you need them."
